BT 1 0 0 1 0 133 Tm /F1 11 Tf 16 TL 1.453556 Tw (In this course I learned how a database is designed and how it is used. I learned to draw) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.492545 Tw (ERDs in SQL Data Modeler, including entities, relationships, and supertype and subtype) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.088071 Tw (entities, and to apply normalization. In Oracle APEX, I learned to create tables with data) Tj T* 0 Tw .418462 Tw (types, primary keys, foreign keys, NOT NULL, and UNIQUE constraints, and to change them) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.1294 Tw (with ALTER TABLE and DROP TABLE. I also learned to add, change, and delete records with) Tj T* 0 Tw .402917 Tw (INSERT, UPDATE, and DELETE, and to retrieve data with SELECT using aliases, arithmetic) Tj T* 0 Tw .325545 Tw (and concatenation, WHERE, LIKE, ORDER BY, DISTINCT, and aggregate functions such as) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.096846 Tw (MIN, MAX, SUM, AVG, and COUNT. Finally, I learned GROUP BY, HAVING, subqueries, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (the different join types: INNER, LEFT, RIGHT, FULL OUTER, NATURAL, and USING.) Tj T* ET
